Build With Parameters:
----------------------
    - used to pass values dynamically while triggered a job
    - avoid creating multiple jobs for different environments (Dev/QA/Prod)
    - can be used to pass values like branch name, environment name, build version, etc.

    why:
    ----
    instead of:
    - 3 jobs --> Dev/QA/Prod
    we create:
        1 job + dynamic parameters
